sweet: tell surya when iOS turns the display off and on

RequestPowerChange calls surya_display_power() (bsd/dev/sweet_touch.c, 0900):
double tap to wake, the torch's long press and the notification LED depend on it.

Also (22.10) counters for suryastat=1 (bsd/dev/sweet_touch.c reads them):
swaps, swaps whose first layer samples like the previous one, panel copies
and their time, vsync ticks, and the panel memory for the copy speed test.
